<title>GERMANY: OECD sees German 1997 inflation at 1.2 percent.</title>
<headline>OECD sees German 1997 inflation at 1.2 percent.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are forecasts for German inflation and unemployment for 1997 and 1998. All</p>
<p>forecasts are in percentage terms unless otherwise indicated.</p>
<p>				     1997	1998     (1996)</p>
<p>    Inflation		    1.2	 1.1	 (1.0)</p>
<p>    Productivity growth	3.2	 2.3	 (2.5)</p>
<p>    Unemployment rate	  11.1	10.9	(10.3)</p>
<p>    Unemployment (millions)  4.3	 4.2	 (4.0)</p>
<p>NOTE - The forecasts were released in a report by the OECD research body.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
